    {
      "label": "Description",
      "value": [
        "A thin sheet of flames shoots forth from you. Each creature in a 15-foot Cone makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d6 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.",
        "Flammable objects in the Cone that aren’t being worn or carried start burning.",
        "Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1."
      ],
      "html": "<div> <p>A thin sheet of flames shoots forth from you. Each creature in a 15-foot <a>Cone</a> makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d6 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.</p> <p>Flammable objects in the Cone that aren’t being worn or carried start <a>burning</a>.</p> <p><strong><em>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</em></strong> The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.</p> </div>",
